: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">gender. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Since, mutants are similar in many ways to human, you just need to create another </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Mutant </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">class that inherits </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Human </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">with the following attributes:\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">    Class Variable\n        </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">count\n                  </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">stores the number of mutants created\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">    Object Variable\n        </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">superpower\n                </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> stores the superpower\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: no